# Verification & Test Tasks

Always run manual verification and test tasks (linters, builds, test suites, pre-commit hooks, etc.) when a workflow or spec requires them.

If the required package or tool is not installed in the current environment, do **not** silently skip the step. Instead, return the exact command to the user so they can run it manually.

```
# ❌ BAD — skipping because tool is missing
"helm is not installed, skipping lint"

# ✅ GOOD — run it when available
helm lint gdfkube-src/gdfkube-orgs/charts/my-chart

# ✅ GOOD — hand off when tool is missing
"I can't run `helm lint` because helm is not installed. Please run:
  helm lint gdfkube-src/gdfkube-orgs/charts/my-chart"
```
